361
00:18:19,934 --> 00:18:21,869
Babe! That's incredible.

362
00:18:21,903 --> 00:18:24,271
-(CHUCKLES)
-(CHUCKLING) Congrats.

363
00:18:24,304 --> 00:18:26,541
Ah, honey, you've worked
so hard for this.

364
00:18:26,574 --> 00:18:28,375
-TIM: Mmm-hmm.
