365
00:18:28,408 --> 00:18:29,777
Come here.

366
00:18:29,811 --> 00:18:31,779
Oh. I'm so proud of you.

367
00:18:33,347 --> 00:18:36,017
When you least expect it,
Tim Timmons!

368
00:18:36,050 --> 00:18:37,451
