Hey! No, actually, really.

404
00:19:47,989 --> 00:19:49,524
-What...
-Stop talking.

405
00:19:49,557 --> 00:19:50,825
Got it. Okay.

406
00:19:56,196 --> 00:19:58,398
You took it too far, Timmons.

407
00:19:58,432 --> 00:20:00,868
Two guitars bagged...

408
00:20:00,902 --> 00:20:02,937
You're ready. Ready.

409
00:20:02,970 --> 00:20:04,204
