TENTH AVENUE NORTH PLAYING)

410
00:20:04,237 --> 00:20:07,240
<i>♪ Afraid to let</i>
<i>your secrets out</i>

411
00:20:07,274 --> 00:20:09,577
<i>♪ Everything that you hide</i>

412
00:20:09,610 --> 00:20:12,947
<i>♪ Comes crashing</i>
<i>through the door now ♪</i>

413
00:20:13,748 --> 00:20:14,849
