-No, no, no. Sorry.

515
00:24:12,186 --> 00:24:13,621
That's... That's stupid.

516
00:24:13,654 --> 00:24:15,856
That's actually not
a bad idea, Bartholomew.

517
00:24:15,890 --> 00:24:16,924
