what I meant.

518
00:24:16,958 --> 00:24:18,526
-What I'm saying is...
-Yes, sir.

519
00:24:18,559 --> 00:24:19,927
We're gonna take
that kid with us.

520
00:24:19,961 --> 00:24:23,030
