you knuckleheads.

533
00:24:50,691 --> 00:24:52,893
Wheels up in five minutes.
Let's go.

534
00:24:54,028 --> 00:24:55,563
-(SHANNON SIGHS)
-SAM: Yeah, it is, it is.

535
00:24:55,596 --> 00:24:56,731
Put your finger right there.

536
00:24:56,764 --> 00:24:58,132
-Okay.
-That's a C chord.

537
00:24:58,165 --> 00:25:00,868
Yeah? And then if you put
one there on this string...

538
00:25:00,901 --> 00:25:02,203
