539
00:25:02,236 --> 00:25:03,270
SAM: ...and that last string...

540
00:25:03,304 --> 00:25:04,638
Yeah, yeah, yeah.
Like that.

541
00:25:04,672 --> 00:25:06,140
Or he just might fix you.

