Fast mover.

549
00:25:22,957 --> 00:25:24,058
BART: Hey. One minute.
SAM: All right, guys.

550
00:25:24,091 --> 00:25:25,993
-BART: Let's go.
-Got you. Okay. Goonies,

551
00:25:26,027 --> 00:25:26,927
never say die.

552
00:25:26,961 --> 00:25:28,796
And don't burn
the house down, all right?

553
