twice.

622
00:28:46,794 --> 00:28:47,928
You can do this.

623
00:28:47,962 --> 00:28:51,432
All right. Ready?
On my count. Three,

624
00:28:51,465 --> 00:28:52,766
two,

625
00:28:53,434 --> 00:28:54,603
one.

626
00:28:54,636 --> 00:28:55,903
-(BREAKS SCREECHING)
